ication in the United States"},{"sentence_id":31,"text":" Finally, It had been unlawful to be charged by an attorney to modify as well as fro banking staff to modify terms to increase a mortgage and or change lending product to a balloon in an concerted effort to make homeowner foreclose which is also illegal, computer fraud and not the governments intended purpose or definition of a modification.","title":"Loan modification in the United States"},{"sentence_id":0,"text":"Villard, also known as Villard Books, is a publishing imprint of Random House, one of the largest publishing companies in the world.","title":"Villard (imprint)"},{"sentence_id":1,"text":" It was founded in 1983.","title":"Villard (imprint)"},{"sentence_id":2,"text":" Villard began as an independent imprint of Random House and is currently a sub-imprint of Ballantine Books, itself an imprint of Random House.","title":"Villard (imprint)"},{"sentence_id":3,"text":" It was named after a Stanford White brownstone mansion on Madison Avenue that was the home of Random House for twenty years.","title":"Villard (imprint)"},{"sentence_id":0,"text":"Real estate benchmarking is the standard of measurement used to analyze the financial characteristics of a real estate investment property.","title":"Real estate benchmarking"},{"sentence_id":1,"text":" In the general sense, real estate benchmarking refers to the comparison of potential real estate investment properties against a predetermined framework of measurement.","title":"Real estate benchmarking"},{"sentence_id":2,"text":" In a narrow sense, the term real estate benchmarking refers to the specific real estate indicators used to measure the real estate properties.","title":"Real estate benchmarking"},{"sentence_id":0,"text":"888 7th Avenue is a 628 ft (191m) tall modern-style office skyscraper in Midtown Manhattan which was completed in 1969 and has 46 floors.","title":"888 7th Avenue"},{"sentence_id":1,"text":" Emery Roth & Sons designed the building, which is tied with Central Park Place for the 65th tallest building in New York City.","title":"888 7th Avenue"},{"sentence_id":2,"text":" It currently carries the Vornado Realty Trust corporate headquarters.","title":"888 7th Avenue"},{"sentence_id":3,"text":" Previously known as the Arlen Building, its namesake being the company responsible for its construction, Arlen Realty & Development Corporation.","title":"888 7th Avenue"},{"sentence_id":4,"text":" The Red Eye Grill is located in the building at street level.","title":"888 7th Avenue"}],"peer_messages":["Unverified peer answer: Yes
